<stddef.h> - Defines basic types and macros like size_t, ptrdiff_t, NULL, and offsetof.
<stdint.h> - Defines exact-width integer types (int32_t, uint8_t, etc.).
<stdbool.h> - Defines bool, true, and false.
<stdarg.h> - Defines macros for handling variable-length argument lists.
<limits.h> - Defines sizes and limits of basic integer types.
<float.h> - Defines limits for floating-point types.
<iso646.h> - Defines alternative spellings for operator tokens (e.g., and, or).

